=== err BadLine (via the buf API)
no line 5 (buffer has 1)
=== err BadCol (via the buf API)
byte column 99 past end of a 5-byte line
=== err NotUtf8 (via the buf API)
line 0 byte 1 is not a UTF-8 boundary
=== err NothingToUndo (via the buf API)
nothing to undo
=== err NothingToRedo (via the buf API)
nothing to redo
=== err AtStart (via the buf API)
already at start of buffer
=== err AtEnd (via the buf API)
already at end of buffer
